Scope of this license
---------------------
This license covers the agent-builder source code: the AgentSpec schema,
the generator, templates, audit/live-test tooling, and the example packs
in this repository.

It does NOT cover the agent packages that agent-builder generates for you.
A generated package (AGENTS.md, skills, schemas, manifest.json, scripts)
is your own work product. Its license is whatever you declare in the
AgentSpec `license` field, which the generator writes into the package's
manifest.json. No attribution to agent-builder is required in generated
packages.

